That chart was interesting. I love mysteries. More to the cozy and soft boiled versus hard core. I get a little squeamish, and I’m prone to nightmares. My favorite author is Sue Grafton. Before I’d heard of soft boiled, I thought she was closer to cozy than hard core, but not quite the Miss Marple type. Now, I know where she fits. Keep writing. I like your mysteries!
